    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Arkanyst Evaluator",
    "summary": "Once per turn, when you select one of your models that has this ability to shoot in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), it can use this ability. If it does, spend 1YP, then:\n\n- For the rest of the phase, its ranged weapons have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- After it shoots this phase, you may gain up to 2YP if those attacks **destroyed** at least one enemy unit.",
